title: "Stream Assembly Is an Uncontrolled Treatment in Streaming Intrusion-Detection Benchmarks: Reproducibility Package"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata. This is
  version 2.2.0 of the record lineage (concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20074589),
  released 2026-09-09 with the revisions of the final pre-submission review
  round added. Version 2.1.0 (doi:10.5281/zenodo.22638195) added the manifests
  of the pre-submission review rounds; version 2.0.0
  (doi:10.5281/zenodo.22213264, published 2026-08-31) is the corrected rebuild
  those versions extend; version 1.0.0 (doi:10.5281/zenodo.20074590, deposited
  2026-05-07) archives the pre-audit codebase cited by arXiv:2605.24696
  v1/v2. All three are superseded by this version.
